# ADIK — Dual License

ADIK (Agentic Development and Implementation Kit) uses a dual-license model
to maximise adoption while protecting the integrity of the standard.

---

## Specification License — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

The following files constitute the **ADIK Specification**:

- `ADIK.md` — Standard Definition
- `ADIK.orchestrator.md` — Operational Orchestrator
- `ADIKbuilder.md` — Framework Orchestrator
- `Registry.md` — Symbol Registry format specification
- `docs/manifesto.md` — ADIK philosophy and principles
- `docs/examples/ADIKBuilderExample.md` — Step-by-step construction guide

