## Reference Implementation License — Apache License, Version 2.0

The following files constitute the **ADIK Reference Implementation**:

- `agents/` — Agent definition files
- `skills/` — Skill definition files
- `mcp/` — MCP server definition
- `adik-lint.py` — ADIK Specification linter

